join Umarell right
if {umarell_hitted} == true:
	Umarell: ...
	Umarell: <I think i will go lay down a bit, my head hurts./Why?/I am older than you can ever imagine.>
	[end_timeline]
if {stick} == true:
	Umarell: Such power, such grace, such umarellitude!
	Umarell: You are indeed a worthy successor.
	[end_timeline]
Umarell: Pah! I am tired of all this!
Umarell: Things are tumbling down and nobody is doing a damn thing about it!
[wait time="0.5" hide_text="false"]
Umarell: Pah! Pthooey!
Umarell: If only i were still eighty years old, i'd whip some sense into everyone!
label first
- Go away.
	Umarell: HEY!
	Umarell: Where do you think you are going?
	jump first
- Get closer.
	[signal arg="fov_1"]
Umarell: Aaah, if only i could instruct someone young and strong in the ancient and sacred arts of...
Umarell: BASHING SOMEONE IN THE HEAD WITH A STICK!
Umarell: That'd be wonderful.
Umarell: Wait...
Umarell: YOU!
Umarell: Come here!
label second
- Run away.
	Umarell: I AM TALKING TO YOU!
	Umarell: YOUNG MAN!
	jump second
- Get even closer.
	[signal arg="fov_2"]
Umarell: I knew you were someone smart!
Umarell: I see it in you, you have something in you.
Umarell: Yes, i can see into you the power of...
Umarell: COMPLAINING LIKE AN OLD MAN!
Umarell: You crave to learn the ancient arts of Umarello-Jutsu!
Umarell: I shall be your master!
label third
- "I don't really want to"
	Umarell: OF COURSE YOU DO!
	jump third
- "YES SENSEI!"
Umarell: PAIN DOES NOT EXIST IN THIS PLAZA, DOES IT?
label fourth
- "A LITTLE BIT, SENSEI!"
	Umarell: THIS IS NOT THE ANSWER!
	jump fourth
- "NO SENSEI!"
[signal arg="fov_0"]
set {stick} = true
[signal arg="umarell"]
join stick center
Umarell: GOOD, YOUR TRAINING START NOW!
Umarell: Here is your weapon!
Umarell: Brandish it with annoyance and pain in your joints!
Umarell: Strike me down, and i shall become older than you can ever imagine.
[signal arg="fov_0"]
audio "res://assets/Music/SFX/MASK 1.wav"
leave stick
Umarell: The student is now the master.
Click the main button to attack